    "sections": {
        "description": "Opulen Shop is a responsive WooCommerce WordPress theme crafted for stylish, high-performing online stores. Perfect for fashion boutiques, lifestyle brands, homeware sellers, and large-scale marketplaces, it combines modern aesthetics with robust eCommerce functionality. With seamless integration for Elementor, Divi, Visual Composer, and full Gutenberg support, customization is effortless. The theme supports RTL languages and includes essential WooCommerce features like product wishlists, comparison tools, and advanced variation swatches to enrich the shopping journey. Built for speed, responsiveness, and elegance, Opulen Shop ensures your store looks sharp on every device. From pixel-perfect layouts to flexible styling options, it empowers you to create a unique brand experience that converts."
    },
